./ I 00145000 $ 00145100 100                                                    
*  DMKSAVNC WRITES THIS MODULE'S OWN STORAGE INTO THE          XA0017DK         
*  NUCLEUS, SO A CACHED PROBE RESULT WOULD PERSIST FROM THE    XA0017DK         
*  S/370 BUILD INTO THE ESA/390 IPL. CLEAR IT AND LET          XA0017DK         
*  XAIOPROB ASK AGAIN. I-100.                                  XA0017DK         
         MVI   XAIOMODE,X'00' RE-PROBE, DO NOT INHERIT         XA0017DK         
./ R 00149100 00150000 $ 00149200 100                                           
*  THE LABEL HERE IS SIO, WHICH IS ALSO A MNEMONIC -- THAT     XA0017DK         
*  HAS ALWAYS BEEN TRUE IN THIS MODULE AND STILL ASSEMBLES.    XA0017DK         
*  R-26: *-4 NAMES IT.                                         XA0017DK         
SIO      XASIO R10                                             XA0017DK         
         BC    7,SIO                                           XA0017DK         
./ R 00151000 00156000 $ 00151100 100                                           
*  AN ENABLED WAIT FOR AN I/O INTERRUPT NEEDS A CR6 SUBCLASS   XA0017DK         
*  MASK AND A DEVICE ADDRESS IN THE I/O OLD PSW, AND ESA/390   XA0017DK         
*  HAS NEITHER. POLL, WHICH IS WHAT THE REST OF THIS MODULE    XA0017DK         
*  DOES. I-102.                                                XA0017DK         
WAITX    DS    0H                                              XA0017DK         
         XATIO R10            POLL FOR COMPLETION              XA0017DK         
         BC    11,WAITX       ANY CC BUT 1: NO STATUS YET      XA0017DK         
IOINT    DS    0H             CC1: THE CSW IS BUILT            XA0017DK         
./ R 00163000 00166000 $ 00163100 100                                           
SAVST1   XASIO R10            START SENSE IO                   XA0017DK         
         BNZ   SAVST1         ..                               XA0017DK         
SAVCL1   XATIO R10            CLEAR IO                         XA0017DK         
         BNZ   SAVCL1         ..                               XA0017DK         
./ R 00166050 00166100 $ 00166051 001                                           
SAVCL2   XATIO R10            DRAIN ANY INTERRUPTS             XA0017DK         
         BC    7,SAVCL2                                        XA0017DK         
SAVST2   XASIO R10            START IT UP                      XA0017DK         
         BC    7,SAVST2       UNTIL FREE                       XA0017DK         
SAVWT2   XATIO R10            TEST FOR COMPLETION              XA0017DK         
         BC    7,SAVWT2       TRY AGAIN                        XA0017DK         
./ R 00236000          $ 00236010 010                                           
XWAIT    DC    X'020E'        EC MODE. I-102.                  XA0017DK         
./ R 00239000          $ 00239010 010                                           
IONP     DC    X'000C0000'    EC MODE. I-102.                  XA0017DK         
./ R 00241000          $ 00241010 010                                           
MCNP     DC    X'000A0000'    EC MODE. I-102.                  XA0017DK         
./ R 00328000          $ 00328010 010                                           
WSC10    DC    X'010E0000'    EC MODE. I-102.                  XA0017DK         
./ R 00330000          $ 00330010 010                                           
WSC11    DC    X'000A0000'    EC MODE. I-102.                  XA0017DK         
./ R 00332000          $ 00332010 010                                           
DISAWT0  DC    X'000A0000'    EC MODE. I-102.                  XA0017DK         
./ R 00334000          $ 00334010 010                                           
EXTINT   DC    X'000C0000'    EC MODE. I-102.                  XA0017DK         
./ R 00603000 00605000 $ 00603100 100                                           
*  AS AT WAITX ABOVE. I-102.                                   XA0017DK         
WAITL    DS    0H                                              XA0017DK         
         XATIO R10            POLL FOR COMPLETION              XA0017DK         
         BC    11,WAITL       ANY CC BUT 1: NO STATUS YET      XA0017DK         
LBIOINT  DS    0H             CC1: THE CSW IS BUILT            XA0017DK         
./ R 00630000          $ 00630010 010                                           
         DC    X'000C0000'    EC MODE. I-102.                  XA0017DK         
./ I 00684000 $ 00684100 100                                                    
*  NO XC OR MVCL EXISTS ANYWHERE IN DMKSAV, SO NOTHING ZEROES  XA0017DK         
*  THIS AND THE PLACEMENT NEEDED NONE OF DMKCKP'S CARE.        XA0017DK         
*  XABLOKS LAST: IT ENDS IN DSECTS. I-55.                      XA0017DK         
         XAIOWORK             XAIO WORK AREAS AND LOOKUP       XA0017DK         
         COPY  XABLOKS        FOR ORBCCWFM, THE CCW FORMAT     XA0017DK         
